{
  "transcript": {
    "duration": 337.68,
    "segments": [
      {
        "id": 0,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 2.0,
        "text": "Good evening; what are you looking for?"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 3.55,
        "end": 7.95,
        "text": "Basic wired earphones with a mic under six hundred rupees."
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 8.750000000000002,
        "end": 9.850000000000001,
        "text": "Nothing fancy."
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 10.950000000000001,
        "end": 17.200000000000003,
        "text": "This one is four ninety nine, with a mic and a three point five millimeter jack. Will that fit your phone?"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 18.750000000000004,
        "end": 24.450000000000006,
        "text": "Yes, my phone has that socket. I'll take this one. Please make the bill."
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 25.66,
        "end": 35.510000000000005,
        "text": "Before billing, just see this nine ninety nine model; better base and a stronger cable. Spend a little more now and take the better one."
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 36.510000000000005,
        "end": 41.16,
        "text": "No, that's over my budget-the four ninety nine one is fine."
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 42.46,
        "end": 49.31,
        "text": "Okay, but take a hard case with it; only ninety nine extra; otherwise the wire gets tangled in your bag."
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 50.836,
        "end": 55.286,
        "text": "I already have a pouch-just the earphones, please-I'm getting late."
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 56.436,
        "end": 66.036,
        "text": "Then one useful offer; these ear phones and this power bank together are seven ninety nine; separately they're nine ninety eight. Shall I put the combo-"
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 66.836,
        "end": 72.736,
        "text": "No, I didn't ask for a power bank. Can you please stop adding things and bill what I selected?"
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 73.236,
        "end": 83.08600000000001,
        "text": "Fine; no power bank, but add our one year replacement protection for ninety nine. It covers accidental cable damage, which the regular warranty doesn't."
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 83.936,
        "end": 90.88600000000001,
        "text": "I've said 'No extras' three times now-I only want to pay four ninety nine and leave!"
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 91.936,
        "end": 100.236,
        "text": "At least take the store membership; it's one forty nine for the year, and you'll get member prices on future purchases. I can add it while billing."
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 101.08,
        "end": 108.18,
        "text": "Don't add any membership! Why aren't you listening! Just give me the bill for the earphones."
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 109.53,
        "end": 118.78,
        "text": "Last thing-the second pair is only three ninety nine with this purchase, to day only. Take a spare now, to morrow this price won't be there."
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 119.68,
        "end": 126.73,
        "text": "Enough! One pair four ninety nine, no extras. If you ask me to buy one more thing, I'm walking out."
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 135.416,
        "end": 137.816,
        "text": "ji, bataiye, kya chahiye?"
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 138.666,
        "end": 141.966,
        "text": "laptop ke liye ek basic wired mouse chahiye,"
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 142.816,
        "end": 143.766,
        "text": "u s bee wala."
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 144.366,
        "end": 146.716,
        "text": "ji, budget kitna rakhna hai?"
      },
      {
        "id": 21,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 148.166,
        "end": 151.566,
        "text": "chaar sau tak. bas normal office work ke liye hai."
      },
      {
        "id": 22,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 152.716,
        "end": 159.966,
        "text": "ye wala teen sau adtalis ka hai, basic wired u s bee mouse hai, aapke budget mein aa jayega."
      },
      {
        "id": 23,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 160.814,
        "end": 164.114,
        "text": "Mere laptop mein normal USB port hai,"
      },
      {
        "id": 24,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 164.964,
        "end": 166.314,
        "text": "seedha lagate hi chalega na?"
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 167.314,
        "end": 173.464,
        "text": "haan ji, usi port mein lagega, alag se software install nahi karna padega."
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 175.01399999999998,
        "end": 178.464,
        "text": "Ek baar click aur scroll check karwa dijiye."
      },
      {
        "id": 27,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 179.314,
        "end": 185.11399999999998,
        "text": "bilkul, counter ke laptop mein laga diya hai, aap khud chala ke dekh lijiye."
      },
      {
        "id": 28,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 185.84799999999998,
        "end": 192.398,
        "text": "haan, sahi chal raha hai yahin pack kar dijiye, payment upi se karunga"
      },
      {
        "id": 29,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 193.048,
        "end": 197.648,
        "text": "ji, total tree hundred forty nine hai ye saamne qr code hai"
      },
      {
        "id": 30,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 198.59799999999998,
        "end": 202.248,
        "text": "kar diya, mere yahan successful dikha raha hai"
      },
      {
        "id": 31,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 203.048,
        "end": 207.548,
        "text": "haanji aa gaya ye aapka mouse aur bill"
      },
      {
        "id": 32,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 208.998,
        "end": 210.948,
        "text": "theek hai, thank you bhaiya"
      },
      {
        "id": 33,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 219.864,
        "end": 222.614,
        "text": "Good evening, sir; what are you looking for?"
      },
      {
        "id": 34,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 223.91400000000002,
        "end": 230.014,
        "text": "A basic seven kilo fully automatic washing machine. My budget is twenty five thousand, maximum."
      },
      {
        "id": 35,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 231.014,
        "end": 240.364,
        "text": "This seven kilo top load model is twenty four thousand four hundred ninety rupees. It has the regular wash programs, and we have a packed piece in stock!"
      },
      {
        "id": 36,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 241.864,
        "end": 245.14000000000001,
        "text": "Fine! this is enough for us. I'll take it!"
      },
      {
        "id": 37,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 246.39000000000001,
        "end": 255.29,
        "text": "Before I make the bill, sir, you can move to this premium model for thirty one thousand nine hundred ninety. You get an inverter motor and quieter operation."
      },
      {
        "id": 38,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 256.34000000000003,
        "end": 257.49,
        "text": "Would you consider that instead?"
      },
      {
        "id": 39,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 258.54,
        "end": 263.74,
        "text": "No; I already told you my maximum budget. Please bill the one I selected."
      },
      {
        "id": 40,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 264.84000000000003,
        "end": 277.25600000000003,
        "text": "Okay, the same model. Would you like to add two years of extended warranty for two thousand four hundred ninety nine rupees? That gives you repair cover after the standard warranty ends, subject to the plan terms."
      },
      {
        "id": 41,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 278.50600000000003,
        "end": 285.50600000000003,
        "text": "No; no extras-first a costlier machine, now extra warranty-can you please just make the bill!"
      },
      {
        "id": 42,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 286.156,
        "end": 292.556,
        "text": "Sorry, sir, I'll bill only the twenty four thousand four hundred ninety machine; nothing extra will be added."
      },
      {
        "id": 43,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 293.646,
        "end": 296.946,
        "text": "It still comes with the normal company warranty, correct?"
      },
      {
        "id": 44,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 298.196,
        "end": 306.196,
        "text": "Yes, the standard two year product warranty is included. The warranty details will be on the invoice and in the booklet."
      },
      {
        "id": 45,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 307.096,
        "end": 311.99600000000004,
        "text": "All right. Can you deliver tomorrow? My flat is about two kilometers from here."
      },
      {
        "id": 46,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 312.54600000000005,
        "end": 318.29600000000005,
        "text": "Yes, tomorrow delivery is available, and that location is within our free delivery area."
      },
      {
        "id": 47,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 319.124,
        "end": 321.824,
        "text": "Please give me your address and mobile number for the booking."
      },
      {
        "id": 48,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 323.124,
        "end": 329.024,
        "text": "I'll write them down, and please check once more only the machine on the bill."
      }
    ],
